# 30. Global Notification Contract

Notifications must correspond to meaningful system events.

Examples:

```text
New anomaly detected
Threat assessment changed
Risk escalated
Investigation updated
Containment authorized
Containment execution failed
Response action completed
Recovery status changed
Critical system degradation
```

Notifications must not become visual noise.

---

# 31. Notification Severity

Conceptually:

```text
INFO
NOTICE
WARNING
CRITICAL
SYSTEM_FAILURE
```

Severity must be semantically meaningful.

Color alone must never communicate severity.

