# 40. Biological Feedback Loop

AEGIS uses the immune-response analogy as a systems-thinking model.

The functional loop is:

```text
DETECTION
   ↓
IDENTIFICATION
   ↓
RESPONSE
   ↓
OBSERVATION
   ↓
OUTCOME
   ↓
LEARNING
   ↓
PREPAREDNESS
   ↓
FUTURE DETECTION
```

The biological analogy must never override actual domain requirements.

AEGIS is not claiming that organizational software literally behaves like an immune system.

---

