The operational version is:

```text
Signal
 ↓
Threat
 ↓
Risk
 ↓
Investigation
 ↓
Intervention
 ↓
Outcome
 ↓
Assessment
 ↓
Adjustment
 ↓
Outcome
```

This creates continuous response refinement.

---

# 42. Institutional Memory Loop

The preparedness feedback loop is:

```text
EVENT
 ↓
RESPONSE
 ↓
OUTCOME
 ↓
LESSON
 ↓
RESILIENCE GAP
 ↓
IMPROVEMENT
 ↓
READINESS
 ↓
FUTURE EVENT
```

The important requirement is:

> Learning must become actionable system knowledge.

A lesson that never influences preparedness is merely historical documentation.

