# 44. State Mutation Classification

Every interaction must be classified as one of:

| Class | Example | Persistence |
|---|---|---|
| UI-only | Open panel | No |
| Context | Select event | Usually no operational persistence |
| Query | Filter | No operational mutation |
| Read | Inspect evidence | No |
| Assessment | Update risk | Yes |
| Investigation | Add finding | Yes |
| Relationship | Associate cases | Yes |
| Recommendation | Propose action | Yes |
| Authorization | Approve action | Yes |
| Execution | Execute action | Yes |
| Verification | Verify outcome | Yes |
| Learning | Add lesson | Yes |

This classification should be encoded into engineering contracts.

